<title>JAPAN: Harima Ceramic - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Harima Ceramic - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 10.90		vs	   11.88</p>
<p> Operating	   65 million	 vs	  310 million</p>
<p> Current	loss 10 million	 vs   prft 154 million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 190 million	 vs   prft 138 million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 5.68 yen	  vs     prft 4.11 yen</p>
<p> Shares		34 million	 vs	   34 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Harima Ceramic Co Ltd makes firebricks and is affiliated with Nippon Steel Corp.</p>
</text>
